        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kɔk Yecu kɛnɛ käpdɛ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kɔr kä mëë ci Yecu rieet ti̱ti̱ lat, cuɛ wä raar kui̱c lo̱o̱lä Kid-ron kɛnɛ jaakɛ kɛɛl, gua̱a̱th mi tekɛ kak jiɛn. Kä cukɛ wä rɛydɛ kɛnɛ jaakɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ Ju-däth, mëë kɔk jɛ, ŋäcɛ gua̱a̱th ɛmɔ bä, kɛ ɣöö la Yecu a duɔl thi̱n ɛn wi̱ni kɛnɛ jaakɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ju-däth wä rɛy kakä a jälɛ kɛɛl kɛ ji̱ rɛ̈m kɛ ga̱a̱ŋ thuɔk luaak Kuɔth ti ca ja̱k ɛ bööth palä tin di̱t kɛ ji̱ Pa-ri-thii, cukɛ wä thi̱n a tekɛ kɛ lɛmbärni kɛnɛ rithni kɛ yio̱w köör. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ŋäc Yecu ɛ ɛn ɣöö kɛn ti̱ti̱ diaal bikɛ tuɔɔk kä jɛ, cuɛ ben kä kɛ, kä cuɛ kɛ thiec i̱, “Go̱o̱r yɛn ni ŋa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ jɛ loc i̱, “Ɛ Yecu raan Na-dha-rɛth.” Cu Yecu kɛ jiök i̱, “Ɛ jɛn ɣän.” Kä te Ju-däth mëë kɔk jɛ cuŋä kɛ kɛ kɛɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min ci Yecu kɛ jiök i̱, “Ɛ jɛn ɣän,” cukɛ rɔ̱ yuɔ̱th jɔk, kä cukɛ tɛɛth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kɛ nyɔk kɛ thiec i̱, “Go̱o̱r yɛn ni ŋa?” Kä cukɛ jɛ loc i̱, “Ɛ Yecu raan Na-dha-rɛth.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu jɛ loc i̱, “Cä jɛ la̱r yɛ ɛn ɣöö ɛ jɛn ɣän. Kä mi go̱o̱r yɛn ni ɣä kua wutni ti̱ti̱ jakä wä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ nɛmɛ lat kɛ ɣöö bi ruac ëë cɛ lat a thuɔ̱k i̱, “Thilɛ kɛl mi cä bath kä nɛy tëë ci ka̱m ɣä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Thay-mɔn Pi-tɔr min tekɛ thɛp, thɛp guëëth raar, kä yɔ̱ɔ̱tdɛ kuany bo̱o̱thä palä in di̱i̱t, kä cuɛ ji̱th cuëëcdɛ ŋuɔk jɔ̱ɔ̱r. Cɔal kɛ ciöt kuanyä nɔmɔ i̱ “Mal-käth”. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yecu Pi-tɔr jiök i̱, “Locni thɛpdu rɛy go̱kädɛ. Ɛ /cä liɛɛr in ci Gua̱a̱r ɛ ka̱m ɣä bi ku math?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yecu nhiam A-nath",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu rɛm kɛ bo̱o̱thdiɛn kɛ lathkëëri ji̱ Juudh Yecu käp, kä cukɛ jɛ yian. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ jɛ naŋ nhiam A-nath kɛ nhiam, min la gua̱nthu Kay-pɛth, min la bo̱o̱th palä in di̱i̱t ɛn runä nɔmɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn Kay-pɛth mëë lueek ji̱ Juudh i̱ gɔaa ni ɣöö bi li̱w ni ram kɛl kɛ kui̱ nɛɛni diaal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ja̱y Pi-tɔr kɛ Yecu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Thay-mɔn Pi-tɔr kɛnɛ jak mi dɔ̱diɛn Yecu guɔ̱ɔ̱r. Kä kɛ ɣöö ŋa̱ckɛ jak ɛmɔ ɛ bo̱o̱th palä in di̱i̱t, cuɛ wä rɛy kal bo̱o̱thä palä in diit kɛ Yecu kɛɛl, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "duundɛ ɣöö cu Pi-tɔr cuɔ̱ŋ raar thok kal. Kä cu jak in ŋa̱ckɛ ɛ bo̱o̱th palä in di̱i̱t wä raar, kä cuɛ ruac kɛ ciek in gaŋ thok kal, kä cuɛ Pi-tɔr nööŋ rɛc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ciek in gaŋ thok kal Pi-tɔr jiök i̱, “/Ciɛ ji̱n ram kɛl kä ji̱ kɔaar wutdä nɛmɛ bä?” Cuɛ wee i̱, “Ëëy, /ciɛ ɣän!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ cu kuaany kɛnɛ bolithni mac miim dɔp, kɛ ɣöö kɔ̱c ɣɔw, kä ɣɔ̱ckɛ cuŋä. Kä te Pi-tɔr cuŋä kɛ kɛ kɛɛl kä ɣɔ̱cɛ bä.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thiecni bo̱o̱th palä in di̱i̱t kɛ Yecu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu bo̱o̱th palä min di̱i̱t Yecu thiec kɛ kui̱ ji̱ kɔaarɛ kɛnɛ ŋi̱i̱cdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu jɛ loc i̱, “Cä ruac a jɔc nhiam nath. Cä naath ŋi̱eec gua̱thni diaal rɛy lueekni palä kɛnɛ rɛy luaak Kuɔth min la ji̱ Juudh diaal a mät thi̱n. Thilɛ ruac mi cä la̱t kɛ tɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛŋu thieci ɣä mɔ? Thiec ni nɛy tin ca ɣä liŋ kɛ kui̱ kä min cä la̱t kɛ. Ŋäc kɛn min cä lar.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë cɛ nɛmɛ lat, cu bolith mi te cuŋä gekä, Yecu pat ni nhiamdɛ, wëë i̱, “Ɛ jɛn luɔc in deri loc ni bo̱o̱th palä in di̱i̱t ɛn nɔmɔ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu jɛ jiök i̱, “Mi cä ruac a jiäk, kä lat min la duerä. Kä mi latdä ni cuɔ̱ɔ̱ŋ, ɛŋu patdi ɣä mɔ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu A-nath jɛ ja̱k ɛ ca yian, naŋkɛ jɛ nhiam Kay-pɛth bo̱o̱th palä in di̱i̱t.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ja̱y Pi-tɔr in rɛwdɛ kɛ Yecu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Min ŋöt Thay-mɔn Pi-tɔr ɣɔ̱cɛ cuŋä. Cukɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “/Ciɛ ji̱n ram kɛl kä ji̱ kɔaarɛ bä?” Cuɛ jɛ gak, kä cuɛ wee i̱, “Ëëy, /ciɛ ɣän.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuany bo̱o̱thä palä in di̱i̱t min la wat kɛ wut ëë ci Pi-tɔr ji̱thdɛ ŋok, thiec i̱, “/Ka̱n ji̱ nɛn rɛy kakä jiɛn kɛ jɛ kɛɛl?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Pi-tɔr ɛ lɛni gak, kä ni ɛn guäth ɛmɔ pa̱ny cu tuut nyaateer wak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yecu nhiam Pay-lɛt",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ Yecu ka̱n dhɔr Kay-pɛth naŋkɛ jɛ dhɔr kua̱r ni Pay-lɛt. Kä ɛ runwaŋ ɛlɔ̱ŋ. Kä /ken ji̱ Juudh pua̱nykiɛn wä guäth luɔ̱k, kɛ ɣöö /cikɛ rɔ̱ bi ya̱r, kɛ ɣöö deekɛ mi̱eth Cäŋ Bälä cam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Pay-lɛt wä raar kä kɛ, kä cuɛ wee i̱, “Go̱o̱nydun kɛ wut ɛmɛ ɛŋu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ jɛ loc i̱, “Mi /ci wut ɛmɛ a gua̱n nyuɔɔni, /cakɔ jɛ dee nöŋ ji̱.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Pay-lɛt kɛ jiök i̱, “Naŋɛ jɛ, wiaa latdɛ lukdɛ ɛ yɛn kɛ ciaŋ ŋuɔ̱tnikun.” Cu ji̱ Juudh ɛ jiök i̱, “Thilɛ nɛy lua̱ŋ rɛy ŋuɔ̱tnikɔ mi dee nɛy ɛ näk ni raan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cua nɛmɛ lat kɛ ɣöö bi ruac ëë ci Yecu ɛ lat a thuɔ̱k, kɛ kui̱ li̱eth in bi li̱w kɛ jɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Pay-lɛt lɛni loc guäth luɔ̱k, kä cuɛ Yecu cɔal nhiamdɛ, cuɛ jɛ thiec i̱, “Ɛ ji̱n Kuäär ji̱ Juudh in di̱i̱t?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu jɛ loc i̱, “Thieci nɛmɛ kɛ ŋäcdu kärɔa, kiɛ ci nɛy kɔ̱kiɛn ɛ la̱r ji̱?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Pay-lɛt jɛ loc i̱, “Lapä raan Juudh? Ci ji̱ dööru kɛnɛ bööth palä tin di̱t ji̱ nööŋ nhiamdä. Ɛŋu ci la̱t ɔ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu jɛ loc i̱, “Kuäärä, /ciɛ duŋ ɣɔaa ɛmɛ. Mi bä kuäärä kä ɣɔw, dee ji̱ kɔaarä ko̱r tɛr, kɛ ɣöö /ca ɣä dee la̱th tetni ji̱ Juudh. Kä /ce̱tnikɛ nɔ ci kuäärä a duŋ ɣɔaa ɛmɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Pay-lɛt ɛ jiök i̱, “Ɛ ji̱n kuäär?” Cu Yecu ɛ loc i̱, “Ci jɛ lar ɛn ɣöö ɛ ɣän kuäär. Diëthkɛ ɣä kɛ kui̱ kä nɛmɛ, kä ba̱a̱ rɛy ɣɔaa kɛ kui̱dɛ, kɛ ɣöö bä nën thukä ben lat. Nɛy diaal tin ji̱ thukä liɛŋkɛ ruacdä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Pay-lɛt ɛ thiec i̱, “Thuɔ̱k ɛŋu?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuɛth Yecu li̱th",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kɔr kä mëë cɛ nɛmɛ lar, cuɛ lɛni wä raar kä ji̱ Juudh, kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Thilɛ duer mi cä jek kä jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ta̱yɛ kɛ ciaŋ ɛn ɣöö la ɣän yɛ a luny ram kɛl kɛ Cäŋ Bälä. Go̱o̱r yɛn ɣöö bä yɛ luɔ̱ny Kuäär ji̱ Juudh?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ jɛ loc kɛ rɔal i̱, “Lunyni kɔ Bä-ra-bäth, a /ci mɔ a wut ɛmɛ!” Kä Bä-ra-bäth ɛmɛ ɛ määc nath.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
